		(property "Description" "SimpleFOC Mini v1.0 BLDC driver module (TI DRV8313, 8-35 V, 2.5 A peak). 3-PWM inputs; EN through 10k into EN1-3; nSP/nRT/nFT pulled up to the module's 3V3 (10 mA output). Pin numbers 1-10 = module header H1, 11 = +, 12 = -, 13-15 = M1-M3."
			(at 228.6 96.52 0)
