	(label "VCC_MCU"
		(at 309.88 200.66 270)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify right bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ef1d4b02-6aee-4a6a-882f-2f51be076528")
	)
	(text "HDD spindle driver: STM32G474 (WeAct Core Board) + SimpleFOC Mini v1.0 (DRV8313) on a carrier\nthat screws to the underside of a 3.5in HDD (M2 screws 2, 3, 7, 8) and contacts the spindle motor's\nthree spring contacts directly (J2). See README.md."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "46a29bbd-53f1-4ec7-98d7-3773ec98d949")
	)
	(text "TIM1 3-PWM: PA8 = CH1 -> IN1, PA9 = CH2 -> IN2, PA10 = CH3 -> IN3 (AF6).\nPB12 -> EN (DRV8313 EN1-3 via 10k on the module; 100k pull-downs keep the driver off at reset).\nPB13 <- nFAULT (open drain, 10k pull-up on the module), PB14 -> nSLEEP, PB15 -> nRESET.\nPA0 = ADC1_IN1 <- VM_SENSE = VM / 11.\nDo not connect the module's 3V3 (DRV8313 regulator output, 10 mA) to the MCU 3V3."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 50.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d93eecf5-b49b-4703-bbbf-f1d0bad8a527")
	)
	(text "JP1 selects the motor supply VM:\n  1-2: external 12 V from J1 (through reverse-polarity diode D1).\n  2-3: USB: WeAct VCC (VBUS minus its Schottky, ~4.6 V) -> MT3608 boost -> VBOOST.\n       Set the boost trimmer to 12 V before fitting the jumper.\nThe DRV8313 needs VM >= 8 V (UVLO), so VM cannot be USB 5 V directly.\nD2 feeds the WeAct VCC (LDO input, 3.3-20 V) from the external 12 V, so the MCU also runs\nwithout USB; the WeAct's own VBUS diode keeps the 12 V away from the USB host."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 264.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6abc90d9-0655-4045-a2cb-eef053d00540")
	)
	(text "J2: the drive's motor springs press on gold pads on the bottom side (B.Cu).\nPhase order is arbitrary: swapping two phases reverses the direction."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 271.78 119.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "41adcacf-6292-457c-82ab-893f6fd0b97d")
	)
