		(uuid "92f285fa-d3e7-4a4b-92ce-7b2a1f9b0745")
	)
	(text "Current sensing (all outputs to ADC pins; 3V3 from the WeAct board). Shunts: 20 mOhm 1 %, 1206, 0.5 W.\n  RS1 + U4 INA181A2: VM bus current, 1 V/A, 0..3.3 A -> I_BUS = PA3 (ADC1_IN4).\n  RS2/RS3 + U5/U6 INA240A1: inline phase A/B current, 0.4 V/A around 1.65 V, +-4 A\n  -> I_A = PA2 (ADC1_IN3), I_B = PA4 (ADC2_IN17): sample both at once in dual ADC mode.\n  U5 inputs are swapped for layout (IN+ = motor side): I_A reads with the opposite sign to I_B.\n  C1/C2 sit after RS1, so I_BUS is the averaged supply current."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 271.78 134.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "71ffe256-51ee-418d-a615-8a30722b84f9")
	)
	(text "VR pickup coil (under the disc, 60 pulses/rev): one end at VR_BIAS = VDD/2, the other\nthrough R6 and the BAV99 clamp to VR_IN = PA1 (COMP1_INP, ADC12_IN2).\nCOMP1 with DAC3 as threshold and hysteresis -> timer input capture for speed and angle."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 271.78 147.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b40bdd07-71b0-4b73-b9e5-0fb7417edc3b")
	)
	(sheet_instances
		(path "/"
			(page "1")
		)
	)
